Gluelump Perimeter Law
Copyright 2026 The Gluelump Perimeter Law Authors

The initial Lean source in this repository was extracted from
strong-coupling-lattice-yang-mills
(https://github.com/rn9801/strong-coupling-lattice-yang-mills), also licensed
under Apache-2.0.  Extracted files retain their original copyright and author
notices.  Module paths were renamed from YangMills.Gluelump.* to
GluelumpPerimeterLaw.*; declaration namespaces were intentionally preserved.

This repository also carries 28 additive compatibility modules developed in
the same source project: 19 extensions of files present on the dependency's
main branch and nine new reflection/thermodynamic-limit modules. They are
installed under GluelumpPerimeterLaw.Upstream.* to avoid claiming upstream
module paths, while their YangMills.* declaration namespaces are preserved
for source compatibility. The Strong-Coupling dependency itself is not
patched or modified by this package.
